 385:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   *         The function @ref HAL_FLASH_Unlock() should be called before to unlock the FLASH interf
 386:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   *         The function @ref HAL_FLASH_OB_Unlock() should be called before to unlock the options b
 387:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   *         The function @ref HAL_FLASH_OB_Launch() should be called after to force the reload of t
